* Discrete device models (ngspice VDMOS / diode / BJT). Sources in README.md.
* IRFP260N, two corners (the low-current transconductance is the main uncertainty):
*   IRFP260N  : "strong", fitted to Infineon's SPICE model (1 A @ 4.40 V, 10 A @ 4.67 V)
*   IRFP260NW : "weak", gfs ~ datasheet minimum (27 S at 28 A)
.model IRFP260N VDMOS(Vto=4.27 Kp=120 lambda=0.002 Rd=15m Rs=12m Rg=1.5 Cgdmax=3n Cgdmin=0.16n a=0.6
+ Cgs=3.9n Cjo=3n m=0.5 vj=0.8 Is=1e-10 n=1.3 Rb=10m ksubthres=0.06)
.model IRFP260NW VDMOS(Vto=4.0 Kp=13 lambda=0.002 Rd=15m Rs=12m Rg=1.5 Cgdmax=3n Cgdmin=0.16n a=0.6
+ Cgs=3.9n Cjo=3n m=0.5 vj=0.8 Is=1e-10 n=1.3 Rb=10m ksubthres=0.12)
* AO3400A: VGS(th) 1.05 V, RDS(on) 19 mOhm @ 4.5 V, Ciss 630 pF, Crss 50 pF, Rg 3 Ohm
.model AO3400A VDMOS(Vto=1.05 Kp=60 Rd=8m Rs=6m Rg=3 Cgdmax=150p Cgdmin=40p a=0.5 Cgs=580p Cjo=120p Is=1e-11 ksubthres=0.1)
.model N2N7002 VDMOS(Vto=1.8 Kp=0.6 Rd=1 Rs=0.5 Rg=10 Cgdmax=8p Cgdmin=2p Cgs=25p Cjo=12p Is=1e-12)
.model Q2N3904 NPN(Is=6.734f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=74.03 Bf=416.4 Ne=1.259 Ise=6.734f Ikf=66.78m Xtb=1.5
+ Br=.7371 Nc=2 Isc=0 Ikr=0 Rc=1 Cjc=3.638p Mjc=.3085 Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=4.493p Mje=.2593 Vje=.75
+ Tr=239.5n Tf=301.2p Itf=.4 Vtf=4 Xtf=2 Rb=10)
.model D1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=0.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=0.4 tt=20n)
.model DZ15 D(Is=1e-12 Rs=2 N=1 Cjo=60p BV=15 IBV=5m)
* BAV199: Nexperia SPICE model parameters (VF ~0.77 V @ 1 mA, 0.89 V @ 10 mA)
.model DBAV199 D(Is=805.84e-18 N=1.0246 Rs=0.05 Ikf=362e-6 Cjo=1.9p M=0.352 Vj=1.27 Tt=1.02u BV=113.3)
